            "review_title": "Review at Cơm Niêu Việt Xưa - Tam Cốc",
            "review_text": "Alexis P\nGeneva, Switzerland132 contributions\n0\nGreat restaurant\nJan 2026 • Couples\nThe restaurant is a gem.\n\nThe menu is quite simple and is perfectly mastered. The service was fast.\n\nWe ordered a fish cooked in a pot, chicken with lemongrass and peppers, pickled eggplants, steamed rice and two drinks.\n\nBefore receiving the dishes, the waiter brought us a whole bowl of soup for free. It was the same broth as the pho soup just without the meat. Worked well as a starter and as a drink to ease the spicy.\n\nAs I ate the chicken I can say that it was delicious. It was grilled and you felt it. The quantity was great. Really yummy.\n\nAs for the rice, the bowl served was gigantic. It was even too much for two people.\n\nFinally, the person that ate the fish said that it was excellent.\n\nGo there, it’s honestly an excellent place.\nRead more\nWritten January 31, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-03",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
