            "review_text": "Tourist11469620508\n3 contributions\n0\nFanstatic experience\nDec 2024 • Family\nI had a fantastic dining experience at this traditional Vietnamese restaurant! The food was absolutely delicious, with fragrant rice cooked in a clay pot and a variety of classic dishes like braised fish, crispy pork belly, and fresh crab soup—all bursting with rich, home-cooked flavors.\n\nThe ambiance was warm and inviting, featuring a charming, vintage Vietnamese design that made the meal feel even more special. The staff was incredibly friendly and attentive, ensuring that everything was perfect from start to finish.\n\nLocated conveniently near major attractions, this restaurant is a must-visit for anyone looking to experience authentic Vietnamese flavors in a cozy and nostalgic atmosphere. Highly recommended! 🌿🍲✨\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten February 7, 2025",
